  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So is it only me, but i often accidentally turn on the panic mode time to time. Especially when i'm using playspace mover. And i'm getting rather sick of it messing up all my \"precious\" custom safety settings. And people around me of course wonder why i muted them for a split second. It just turns into an awkward situation. So i feel like having an option to customize how the panic mode should behave, what to toggle and what to not toggle. Or do anything at all etc.\nSince the safety system got implemented the panic mode isn't as necessary as it used to be back in the day and i feel like customization is important for this.",
